@startuml RestroVibes - Service Management
!theme plain
title RestroVibes - Restaurateur Service Management

actor Restaurateur as R
actor Client as C
participant "Frontend" as FE
participant "Express API" as API
participant "PostgreSQL" as DB

== RESTAURATEUR: ADD SERVICE ==

R -> FE : Create new service\n(name, price, duration)
FE -> API : POST /api/restaurateurs-services/\n{ name: "Veg Thali", price: 500,\nduration: 45 }
API -> API : resolveRestaurateurId():\nExtract restaurateurId from JWT\nVerify token.id == body.restaurateurId
API -> DB : Check unique constraint\n(restaurateurId, name)
API -> DB : INSERT INTO restaurateur_services\n(name, price, duration, restaurateurId)
DB --> API : Service created (id=3)
API --> FE : 201 { service: { id: 3, name: "Veg Thali",\nprice: 500, duration: 45 }}

== RESTAURATEUR: UPDATE SERVICE ==

R -> FE : Edit service details
FE -> API : PUT /api/restaurateurs-services/:id\n{ name: "Veg Thali Deluxe", price: 650 }
API -> API : resolveRestaurateurId():\nVerify ownership
API -> DB : Find service WHERE id AND restaurateurId
DB --> API : Service found
API -> DB : UPDATE name, price, duration
API --> FE : 200 Updated

== RESTAURATEUR: DELETE SERVICE ==

R -> FE : Delete service
FE -> API : DELETE /api/restaurateurs-services/:id
API -> API : resolveRestaurateurId():\nVerify ownership
API -> DB : DELETE FROM restaurateur_services\nWHERE id AND restaurateurId
API --> FE : 200 Deleted

== CLIENT: VIEW SERVICES ==

C -> FE : Browse restaurant services
FE -> API : GET /api/restaurateurs-services/all\n?restaurateurId=15&dynamic=true
API -> DB : SELECT * FROM restaurateur_services\nWHERE restaurateurId = 15
DB --> API : Service list
API -> DB : For dynamic mode:\nCOUNT active appointments today\n+ fetch seat_capacity
DB --> API : demandInfo = {\n  activeAppointments: 12,\n  totalCapacity: 20\n}
API --> FE : [{\n  id: 3,\n  name: "Veg Thali",\n  price: 500,\n  duration: 45,\n  demandInfo: { activeAppointments: 12,\n  totalCapacity: 20 }\n}]

== RESTAURATEUR: GET RESTAURANT PROFILE ==

R -> FE : View my restaurant profile
FE -> API : GET /api/restaurateurs-services/:id\n(restaurateur ID)
API -> DB : SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE id = :id AND role = 'restaurateurs'
DB --> API : Restaurant profile
API --> FE : {\n  name: "Bhojan Griha",\n  email: "info@bhojangriha.com",\n  phone: "9841234567",\n  seat_capacity: 20,\n  opening_time: "10:00",\n  closing_time: "22:00",\n  latitude: 27.7100,\n  longitude: 85.3180\n}

== SEAT CAPACITY MANAGEMENT ==

R -> FE : Update seat capacity
FE -> API : PUT /api/users/restaurateur/:id/capacity\n{ seat_capacity: 25 }
API -> API : Verify: caller is restaurateur\nAND matches :id
API -> DB : UPDATE seat_capacity = 25\nWHERE id = :id
API --> FE : 200 Capacity updated

@enduml
